<title>UK: TABLE-Morrison yr pretax profit jumps 42 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Morrison yr pretax profit jumps 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 15.97		 vs  13.12</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   3.5		  vs   3.05</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   5.14		 vs  up 12 pct</p>
<p> Pretax			16.2		  vs  11.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   300.0		  vs 209.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The total dividend represents an increase of some 12 percent over a notional, full-year dividend for the previous year. The company's flotation was in October 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name - Morrison Construction Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
